category: Devel
build-depends: cygport mingw64-i686-libogg mingw64-i686-libtheora mingw64-i686-libvorbis mingw64-i686-speex
sdesc: "Library for accessing a shoutcast/icecast server (with IDJC) for Win32 toolchain"
ldesc: "Internet DJ Console is a project started in March 2005
 to provide a powerful yet easy to use source-client for individuals
 interested in streaming live radio shows over the Internet using
 Shoutcast or Icecast servers."
